'''Tomato Seeds''' are a type of seed. Mature plants yield [[Tomato]]es.

They can be purchased  at [[Pierre's General Store]], at [[JojaMart]], from the Magic Shop Boat at the [[Night Market]] on Winter 16, and occasionally from the [[Traveling Cart]]. They can also be obtained by using the [[Seed Maker]].  Five to twenty Tomato Seeds may occasionally be found in [[Skull Cavern#Treasure Rooms|treasure rooms]] in the Skull Cavern.

